#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068599 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068761 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "da0ca17e-50f3-5f67-bb1c-27868f7b4f45" :knowledge-point/title "Dividing a Cubic Polynomial by a Quadratic Polynomial"}] :question/id #uuid "a2aac357-23c5-5038-84c6-bc263bd45afa" :question/math-academy-id "e-5143" :question/problem "Determine the quotient and remainder of $6x^3-x^2+3x+1$ divided by $3x^2+x+2.$" :question/worked-solution "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2x-1 \\\\  & 3{x}^{2}+x+2\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,6{x}^{3}-\\phantom{0}{x}^{2}+3x+1\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{6{x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}+4x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-3{x}^{2}-x+1 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,3{x}^{2}-x-2}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n- the quotient is ${\\color{blue}2x-1},$ and\n\n- the remainder is ${\\color{red}3}.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068600 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068762 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "525be9c7-af11-506b-be69-444dfc640add" :knowledge-point/title "Dividing Polynomials When the Dividend Contains Zero Coefficients"}] :question/id #uuid "bd9a160c-574e-506e-865c-d08061c75aed" :question/math-academy-id "e-5144" :question/problem "Find the quotient and remainder of the following division problem:\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{2x^4 - 7x^2 - x + 8}{x^2 - 1}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that the dividend is missing the $x^3$ term. So, we first rewrite it by including the missing term with a coefficient of zero, as follows:\n\n$$\n2x^4-7x^2-x+8 = 2x^4+{\\color{red}0}x^3-7x^2-x+8\n$$\n\nNow, using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2{x}^{2}-5 \\\\  & {x}^{2}-1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,2{x}^{4}+0{x}^{3}-7{x}^{2}-\\phantom{0}x+8\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{2{x}^{4}+0{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-5{x}^{2}-x+8 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,5{x}^{2}+0x+5}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-x+3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs a result, \n\n- the quotient is ${2x^2 - 5},$ and\n\n- the remainder is ${-x+3}.$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{2x^4 - 7x^2 - x +8}{x^2 - 1} \n= \n2x^2-5 + \\dfrac{-x+3}{x^2-1}.\n$$\n\nWe can rewrite this result as follows:\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{2x^4 - 7x^2 - x +8}{x^2 - 1} \n= \n2x^2-5 - \\dfrac{x-3}{x^2-1}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068660 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068817 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "76a7314b-4ebf-52eb-b464-97865ea9a81e" :knowledge-point/title "Dividing a Quartic Polynomial by a Quadratic or Cubic Polynomial"}] :question/id #uuid "9438b41b-2ad4-5248-881c-cb938b6cf1c3" :question/math-academy-id "e-8932" :question/problem "Find the quotient and remainder of the following division problem:\n\n$$\n\\dfrac {5x^4- 2x^3 - 18x^2 + 11x - 13} {5x^2-2x+2}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{x}^{2}-4 \\\\  & 5{x}^{2}-2x+2\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,5{x}^{4}-2{x}^{3}-18{x}^{2}+11x-13\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{5{x}^{4}-2{x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-20{x}^{2}+11x-13 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,20{x}^{2}+8x-8}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3x-5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs a result,\n\n- the quotient is $x^2-4,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $3x-5.$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\dfrac{5x^4-2x^3-18x^2+11x-13}{5x^2-2x+2}=x^2-4 + \\dfrac{3x-5}{5x^2-2x+2}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186069008 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068761 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "da0ca17e-50f3-5f67-bb1c-27868f7b4f45" :knowledge-point/title "Dividing a Cubic Polynomial by a Quadratic Polynomial"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "480e7d61-052d-56a9-8800-d5f9baca0304" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2x-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553019} {:answer/id #uuid "88454841-81ec-5fc0-a89a-2f52aaf853f6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2x-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553141} {:answer/id #uuid "922ccc49-01dc-5279-9310-1d5e29f67486" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3x-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553164} {:answer/id #uuid "a33622aa-ecae-5331-bfaa-8d8a6255d2b4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3x-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553197} {:answer/id #uuid "c25a9067-676c-50c7-8dd4-db8ea4ad63e0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3x+2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553254}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a33622aa-ecae-5331-bfaa-8d8a6255d2b4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3x-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553197} :answer-field/id #uuid "c3ed1c86-90d0-5135-99d4-d1118977370d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186065481}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "4d8bc05a-3c12-5aa5-909c-eac9c4d84a12" :question/math-academy-id "q-104246" :question/problem "What is the quotient of $3{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}-x-1$ divided by ${x}^{2}+x+1?$" :question/worked-solution "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3x-5 \\\\  & {x}^{2}+x+1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,3{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}-\\phantom{0}x-1\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{3{x}^{3}+3{x}^{2}+3x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-5{x}^{2}-4x-1 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,5{x}^{2}-5x-5}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,x+4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n- the quotient is $3x-5,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $x+4.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186069009 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068762 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "525be9c7-af11-506b-be69-444dfc640add" :knowledge-point/title "Dividing Polynomials When the Dividend Contains Zero Coefficients"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "958c6214-2387-5a46-83ce-f4c6ad535ce6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186065488} {:answer/id #uuid "5346c601-9c4e-5ddf-a193-70ba90454c28" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186065491} {:answer/id #uuid "302aea0d-0629-5728-adeb-a6036ea8baed" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x+2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186552957} {:answer/id #uuid "82e922b7-3dcd-5e38-be32-18f0ee92c416" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553132} {:answer/id #uuid "aa5ec297-5063-53e2-a689-1f98b7739fb1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2x+1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553212}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "82e922b7-3dcd-5e38-be32-18f0ee92c416" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553132} :answer-field/id #uuid "3c658fbe-dc97-5df0-b919-b3101b651d75" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186065487}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "b5c06d52-b891-50af-98a6-86efeb0cc9c3" :question/math-academy-id "q-104250" :question/problem "What is the remainder when $-2{x}^{4}+{x}^{3}-3{x}^{2}+1$ is divided by $2{x}^{2}-x+5?$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that the dividend is missing the $x$ term. So, we first rewrite it by including the missing term with a coefficient of zero, as follows:\n\n$$\n-2{x}^{4}+{x}^{3}-3{x}^{2}+1=-2{x}^{4}+{x}^{3}-3{x}^{2}+0x+1\n$$\n\nNow, using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,-{x}^{2}+1 \\\\  & 2{x}^{2}-x+5\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,-2{x}^{4}+{x}^{3}-3{x}^{2}+0x+1\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,2{x}^{4}+{x}^{3}-5{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2{x}^{2}+0x+1 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{2{x}^{2}-x+5}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,x-4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n- the quotient is $-{x}^{2}+1,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $x-4.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186069010 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068817 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "76a7314b-4ebf-52eb-b464-97865ea9a81e" :knowledge-point/title "Dividing a Quartic Polynomial by a Quadratic or Cubic Polynomial"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0ba2998d-4829-5f91-add0-da81bbe37687" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x+2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186552880} {:answer/id #uuid "2d59bce2-4bc6-566a-bf9e-3a8d96684f51" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x+7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186552953} {:answer/id #uuid "316363e9-eecc-5eb4-9b74-3a01ae716a23" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-7x+1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186552959} {:answer/id #uuid "82b94e67-b0af-59b1-8b23-e0bcdffcc05b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-7x-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553131} {:answer/id #uuid "a403c8ad-2161-5ad5-9fe5-331690437f20" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-7x+7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553198}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a403c8ad-2161-5ad5-9fe5-331690437f20" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-7x+7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553198} :answer-field/id #uuid "d1f35cfe-1f68-5083-8599-cf6709dac637" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186065493}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "f43b46ed-bff2-5d10-a08b-b040b0fe854b" :question/math-academy-id "q-104252" :question/problem "What is the remainder when  $-12{x}^{4}+28{x}^{3}-47{x}^{2}+25x-9$ is divided by $6{x}^{2}-5x+4?$" :question/worked-solution "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-2{x}^{2}+3x-4 \\\\  & 6{x}^{2}-5x+4\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,-12{x}^{4}+28{x}^{3}-47{x}^{2}+25x-\\phantom{0}9\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-12{x}^{4}+10{x}^{3}-8{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,18{x}^{3}-39{x}^{2}+25x-9 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{18{x}^{3}-15{x}^{2}+12x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-24{x}^{2}+13x-9 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,24{x}^{2}+20x-16}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-7x+7\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n- the quotient is $-2{x}^{2}+3x-4,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $-7x+7.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186553549 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068817 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "76a7314b-4ebf-52eb-b464-97865ea9a81e" :knowledge-point/title "Dividing a Quartic Polynomial by a Quadratic or Cubic Polynomial"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0aa146ec-87f8-5eb8-949b-2bcb1af0b5c2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2{x}^{2}+2+\\frac{x-3}{2{x}^{2}-x-2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186552879} {:answer/id #uuid "95c405b3-9f0f-5a45-945d-f004cb8f17e8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2{x}^{2}-2+\\frac{x-3}{2{x}^{2}-x-2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553171} {:answer/id #uuid "a2cf5715-795e-54a3-897f-f072d46be8d9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2{x}^{2}+2-\\frac{x-3}{2{x}^{2}-x-2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553196} {:answer/id #uuid "e396f5ab-3f1c-5637-995d-c1f8c1ed5210" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2{x}^{2}-2+\\frac{2{x}^{2}-x-2}{x-3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553321} {:answer/id #uuid "f4447bc3-c94e-5cef-961b-b641dc7fda56" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x-3+\\frac{2{x}^{2}-2}{2{x}^{2}-x-2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553348}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "95c405b3-9f0f-5a45-945d-f004cb8f17e8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2{x}^{2}-2+\\frac{x-3}{2{x}^{2}-x-2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553171} :answer-field/id #uuid "74de3a66-9ad1-5ad1-a430-c549e278e70e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553431}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "8bc4fde0-a670-521d-a87d-b0fba4bc56ab" :question/math-academy-id "q-18395" :question/problem "$\\frac{4{x}^{4}-2{x}^{3}-8{x}^{2}+3x+1}{2{x}^{2}-x-2}=$" :question/worked-solution "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2{x}^{2}-2 \\\\  & 2{x}^{2}-x-2\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,4{x}^{4}-2{x}^{3}-8{x}^{2}+3x+1\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{4{x}^{4}-2{x}^{3}-4{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-4{x}^{2}+3x+1 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,4{x}^{2}+2x+4}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,x-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n- the quotient is $2{x}^{2}-2,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $x-3.$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\frac{4{x}^{4}-2{x}^{3}-8{x}^{2}+3x+1}{2{x}^{2}-x-2}=2{x}^{2}-2+\\frac{x-3}{2{x}^{2}-x-2}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186553494 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068762 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "525be9c7-af11-506b-be69-444dfc640add" :knowledge-point/title "Dividing Polynomials When the Dividend Contains Zero Coefficients"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1cfa05af-ca7a-571e-9c6e-43a341402226" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-x+3-\\frac{7{x}^{2}+x-2}{-2{x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}-1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186552921} {:answer/id #uuid "4d8c0d78-9f1f-5ac5-869f-010f625edbd1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-x-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553038} {:answer/id #uuid "d414e935-1288-5f4a-84dc-255ee9a79b9c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-x-3-\\frac{-2{x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}-1}{7{x}^{2}+x-2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553293} {:answer/id #uuid "dadc6221-06c5-5b90-b741-26314c2f92bc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-x+3+\\frac{7{x}^{2}+x-2}{-2{x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}-1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553304} {:answer/id #uuid "ebf743d2-b86a-502c-9e21-37812372b453" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-x-3+\\frac{7{x}^{2}+x-2}{-2{x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}-1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553337}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ebf743d2-b86a-502c-9e21-37812372b453" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-x-3+\\frac{7{x}^{2}+x-2}{-2{x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}-1}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553337} :answer-field/id #uuid "30da67a6-84f4-5d3b-ab54-889b410de1f1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553395}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "0cb3699b-22c9-5a80-a605-3b7138e8d50e" :question/math-academy-id "q-18417" :question/problem "$\\frac{2{x}^{4}-11{x}^{2}+2x+1}{-2{x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}-1}=$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that the dividend is missing the ${x}^{3}$ term. So, we first rewrite it by including the missing term with a coefficient of zero, as follows:\n\n$$\n2{x}^{4}-11{x}^{2}+2x+1=2{x}^{4}+0{x}^{3}-11{x}^{2}+2x+1\n$$\n\nNow, using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,-x-3 \\\\  & -2{x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}-1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,2{x}^{4}+0{x}^{3}-11{x}^{2}+2x+1\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{2{x}^{4}-6{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}+x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,6{x}^{3}-11{x}^{2}+x+1 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{6{x}^{3}-18{x}^{2}+0x+3}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,7{x}^{2}+x-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs a result, \n\n- the quotient is $-x-3,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $7{x}^{2}+x-2.$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{2{x}^{4}-11{x}^{2}+2x+1}{-2{x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}-1}=-x-3+\\frac{7{x}^{2}+x-2}{-2{x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}-1}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186553571 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068761 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "da0ca17e-50f3-5f67-bb1c-27868f7b4f45" :knowledge-point/title "Dividing a Cubic Polynomial by a Quadratic Polynomial"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "35aa2a07-24d1-579a-9b5c-82a8945eda7f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "57x-77" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186552970}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "35aa2a07-24d1-579a-9b5c-82a8945eda7f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "57x-77" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186552970} :answer-field/id #uuid "1198596c-3324-5f40-9107-0758caa3b87f" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553384} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bf0fafa5-1678-5bbe-96c9-55341730fb3e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "10x+23" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553248}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "bf0fafa5-1678-5bbe-96c9-55341730fb3e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "10x+23" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553248} :answer-field/id #uuid "40253f99-039f-51c2-984b-efbd55e8d3ed" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553402}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "ca48cb34-e90b-5e17-8caa-9e1b065ee2bb" :question/math-academy-id "q-270090" :question/problem "Express $\\frac{20{x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}-5x-8}{2{x}^{2}-4x+3}$ in the form $q(x)+\\frac{r(x)}{2{x}^{2}-4x+3},$ where $q(x)$ is the quotient and $r(x)$ is the reminder of the division.$$\n\n| $20{x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}-5x-8$ | __ | {{field-1}} | $+$ | {{field-2}} |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $2{x}^{2}-4x+3$ | __ |  |  | $2{x}^{2}-4x+3$ |" :question/worked-solution "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,10x+23 \\\\  & 2{x}^{2}-4x+3\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,20{x}^{3}+\\phantom{0}6{x}^{2}-\\phantom{0}5x-\\phantom{0}8\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{20{x}^{3}-40{x}^{2}+30x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,46{x}^{2}-35x-8 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{46{x}^{2}-92x+69}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,57x-77\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs a result, \n\n- the quotient is $10x+23,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $57x-77.$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{20{x}^{3}+6{x}^{2}-5x-8}{2{x}^{2}-4x+3}=10x+23+\\frac{57x-77}{2{x}^{2}-4x+3}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186553557 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068762 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "525be9c7-af11-506b-be69-444dfc640add" :knowledge-point/title "Dividing Polynomials When the Dividend Contains Zero Coefficients"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a1e329a9-ea10-5f53-a935-c6ea9376d118" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6x^2-6x+3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553195}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a1e329a9-ea10-5f53-a935-c6ea9376d118" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6x^2-6x+3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553195} :answer-field/id #uuid "4c04379e-59f6-5bec-875b-6f69849f6bbc" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553413}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "99ee3ecb-35ab-58a3-9bc3-d74b99668ec7" :question/math-academy-id "q-270166" :question/problem "What is the quotient of $12{x}^{4}-5$ divided by $-2{x}^{2}+2x-3?$\n\nThe quotient is\n{{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "Notice that the dividend is missing the ${x}^{3},{x}^{2}$ and $x$ terms. So, we first rewrite it by including the missing terms with zero coefficients, as follows:\n\n$$\n12{x}^{4}-5=12{x}^{4}+0{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}+0x-5\n$$\n\nNow, using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-6{x}^{2}-6x+3 \\\\  & -2{x}^{2}+2x-3\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,12{x}^{4}+\\phantom{0}0{x}^{3}+\\phantom{0}0{x}^{2}+\\phantom{0}0x-5\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{12{x}^{4}-12{x}^{3}+18{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,12{x}^{3}-18{x}^{2}+0x-5 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{12{x}^{3}-12{x}^{2}+18x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,6{x}^{2}-18x-5 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,6{x}^{2}+6x-9}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,24x+4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n- the quotient is $-6{x}^{2}-6x+3,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $-24x+4.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186553495 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068762 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "525be9c7-af11-506b-be69-444dfc640add" :knowledge-point/title "Dividing Polynomials When the Dividend Contains Zero Coefficients"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f87c46d2-9411-5999-9c7f-5eac7fb5344f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4x^2-6x+1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553362}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f87c46d2-9411-5999-9c7f-5eac7fb5344f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4x^2-6x+1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553362} :answer-field/id #uuid "b5b1b578-337f-5ed8-beb9-491bd54e7954" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553461}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "0cc307df-ec47-5e9f-872f-4b9b3e943019" :question/math-academy-id "q-324365" :question/problem "What is the quotient of $8{x}^{4}+24x+2$ divided by $-2{x}^{2}+3x-5?$\n\nThe quotient is\n{{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "Notice that the dividend is missing the ${x}^{3}$ and ${x}^{2}$ terms. So, we first rewrite it by including the missing terms with zero coefficients, as follows:\n\n$$\n8{x}^{4}+24x+2=8{x}^{4}+0{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}+24x+2\n$$\n\nNow, using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-4{x}^{2}-6x+1 \\\\  & -2{x}^{2}+3x-5\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,8{x}^{4}+\\phantom{0}0{x}^{3}+\\phantom{0}0{x}^{2}+24x+2\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{8{x}^{4}-12{x}^{3}+20{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,12{x}^{3}-20{x}^{2}+24x+2 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{12{x}^{3}-18{x}^{2}+30x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,2{x}^{2}-6x+2 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,2{x}^{2}+3x-5}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,9x+7\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n- the quotient is $-4{x}^{2}-6x+1,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $-9x+7.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186553501 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068761 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "da0ca17e-50f3-5f67-bb1c-27868f7b4f45" :knowledge-point/title "Dividing a Cubic Polynomial by a Quadratic Polynomial"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3ad9191c-ea87-58b9-b4aa-6a2631912632" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186552988} {:answer/id #uuid "90bb1b62-5c5f-5f27-a324-58253b06ed3d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553157} {:answer/id #uuid "c24a8b0b-fcfe-5c4d-8e6e-d076a4cdabd2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553253} {:answer/id #uuid "c6ad0b6f-8a31-57bf-bc59-41c6daef7b43" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553264} {:answer/id #uuid "e44a5bb1-c6d4-58cb-b3bd-fa0c7f1d5351" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553323}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c24a8b0b-fcfe-5c4d-8e6e-d076a4cdabd2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553253} :answer-field/id #uuid "028926cf-fca8-5fac-bf47-d68f8cec4bfe" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553377}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "21ff56f4-ae4e-5c23-af7e-5388474cb582" :question/math-academy-id "q-37940" :question/problem "What is the remainder when $3{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}-18x-1$ is divided by $3{x}^{2}-8x-2?$" :question/worked-solution "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,x+2 \\\\  & 3{x}^{2}-8x-2\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,3{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}-18x-1\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{3{x}^{3}-8{x}^{2}-2x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,6{x}^{2}-16x-1 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{6{x}^{2}-16x-4}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n- the quotient is $x+2,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $3.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186553500 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068761 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "da0ca17e-50f3-5f67-bb1c-27868f7b4f45" :knowledge-point/title "Dividing a Cubic Polynomial by a Quadratic Polynomial"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "082d317c-2419-5ca8-be39-772653d8c4bc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-x+1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186552876} {:answer/id #uuid "55e59328-b487-5b83-a838-132939e72155" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4x-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553052} {:answer/id #uuid "db0ac519-877a-5d8d-979c-a9690797f916" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553305} {:answer/id #uuid "dd6cfbba-1471-550a-804e-7b4e8a9b3f6f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553308} {:answer/id #uuid "e04ec805-1004-5568-b707-8dae8447dc7a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553314}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "db0ac519-877a-5d8d-979c-a9690797f916" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553305} :answer-field/id #uuid "081a4661-fe06-5d76-a560-f0ba2c3ac13c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553380}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "1eb31ef2-fef5-5bd3-b730-66864ae07e56" :question/math-academy-id "q-37960" :question/problem "What is the quotient of ${x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}+x+1$ divided by ${x}^{2}+2x+1?$" :question/worked-solution "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,x \\\\  & {x}^{2}+2x+1\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,{x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}+x+1\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{{x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}+x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n- the quotient is $x,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $1.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186553487 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186068761 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "da0ca17e-50f3-5f67-bb1c-27868f7b4f45" :knowledge-point/title "Dividing a Cubic Polynomial by a Quadratic Polynomial"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1ac723e7-52c4-54cb-a3f4-40cdbf0e98e3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4x-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186552914} {:answer/id #uuid "3ecfaa08-80ea-5362-a425-c6f2396bf209" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4x+2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186552994} {:answer/id #uuid "41ce29f7-d071-54b2-8a2d-d7b5aa736b9a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2x+2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553002} {:answer/id #uuid "cfac7d0a-5521-5a43-b087-b29b9196f62a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "x+2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553283} {:answer/id #uuid "f3738603-0ae7-5e1f-b4e5-2a41cf94682e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553345}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3ecfaa08-80ea-5362-a425-c6f2396bf209" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4x+2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186552994} :answer-field/id #uuid "8dcedd02-deb6-564a-873c-dccadeff87ea" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186553441}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "00e30455-d65a-5c3e-852c-94513d65dea1" :question/math-academy-id "q-38029" :question/problem "What is the quotient of $48{x}^{3}+16{x}^{2}-12x-4$ divided by $12{x}^{2}-2x-2?$" :question/worked-solution "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,4x+2 \\\\  & 12{x}^{2}-2x-2\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,48{x}^{3}+16{x}^{2}-12x-4\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{48{x}^{3}-8{x}^{2}-8x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,24{x}^{2}-4x-4 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{24{x}^{2}-4x-4}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n- the quotient is $4x+2,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $0.$"}]}
